                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Hellenica is to Final Fantasy Tactics as Tactical Breach Wizards is to X-COM. It leaves a good first impression, but it doesn't have the mechanical variety to sustain the full game and soon enough it turns into a repetitive slog. There's fun to be had here with the right expectations, but I wish the developer was still around to iterate on the ideas further.",
